OpenCV Wrapper Library
This project builds a shared C++ library (libopencv_wrapper.so) using OpenCV, with optional support for libcamera. It is intended for use in applications that need a simplified interface to OpenCV functionality.

Requirements:
C++17 compiler (e.g., g++)

OpenCV 4 (must be installed and available via pkg-config)
Should be able to install it using 'sudo apt install libopencv-dev'

(Optional) libcamera and lccv, if enabling camera support
libcamera - can be installed uisng 'sudo apt install libcamera-dev'
liblccv.so - should be either in the ert-contrib-middleware  (e.g. ert-contrib-middleware/target_libs/arm64-linux-gnu-clang11_debian11_base/build/lib/liblccv.so) 
or it needs to be built from source https://github.com/kbarni/LCCV

Files:
opencv_wrapper.c: Source code for the OpenCV wrapper

Makefile: Build instructions

Output: libopencv_wrapper.so

Build Instructions:
Standard build (no libcamera support):

make

Build with libcamera support:

make OPENCV_LIBCAMERA_SUPPORT=1


Clean Build Files:
To remove the compiled shared object:

make clean

